   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FAO avtal jordbruk</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1 Ett partnerskap mellan FAO och Sida inom livsmedelss&#xe4;kerhet, h&#xe5;llbara utvecklingsinsatser inom jordbruk, s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;llande av erfarenheter inom livsmedelss&#xe4;kerhet och utpl&#xe5;nande av fattigdom. Tillhandah&#xe5;lla en ramverk f&#xf6;r resultatuppf&#xf6;ljning, reducerade administrativa kostnader, &#xf6;kad &#xf6;ppenhet, ansvar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership between FAO and Sida with among othr things the guiding principles:- Foster close collaboration at all levels on food security, and environmental sustainability issues in agriculture - Build upon each others comparative advantages to achieve food security and eradicating rural poverty. - Provide RBM framework reducing adm costs, raising transparency, accountability, etc.</narrative>
  </description>
